{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610281942203321155968268d9d6Q6MWYTq6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_95db4d23c09e45debab3b4eb0aa24041","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"0:1\");\n  if (!page) return `Page 0:1 not found.`;\n  \n  const textNodes = [];\n  function traverse(node) {\n    if (node.type === \"TEXT\") {\n      textNodes.push({\n        name: node.name,\n        characters: node.characters,\n        x: node.absoluteTransform ? node.absoluteTransform[0][2] : 0,\n        y: node.absoluteTransform ? node.absoluteTransform[1][2] : 0\n      });\n    }\n    if (\"children\" in node) {\n      for (const child of node.children) {\n        traverse(child);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  traverse(page);\n  \n  textNodes.sort((a, b) => {\n    if (Math.abs(a.y - b.y) < 20) {\n      return a.x - b.x;\n    }\n    return a.y - b.y;\n  });\n  \n  return textNodes.map(t => `[${t.name}] ${t.characters}`).join(\"\\n\\n\");\n})()\n","description":"Extract text details from the \"00 · Start Here\" page to understand the design requirements.","fileKey":"pNVsMbFlqHuHgCQFsjUPkH"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11267,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"494b4549-32cd-4fcc-b024-fd0ae7aff445","uuid":"19b16f44-f04d-41cf-b61c-558c73c5a0b7","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:42:25.828Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_95db4d23c09e45debab3b4eb0aa24041","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_95db4d23c09e45debab3b4eb0aa24041","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[DESIGNER STARTER / FOODGO · LEVEL L2 · v2] DESIGNER STARTER / FOODGO · LEVEL L2 · v2\n\n[Complete mobile product design] Complete mobile product design\n\n[Content, structure, the two brand colors and typefaces are fixed. Layout, hierarchy, all other colors, states, components and visual system are yours.] Content, structure, the two brand colors and typefaces are fixed. Layout, hierarchy, all other colors, states, components and visual system are yours.\n\n[THE ASSIGNMENT] THE ASSIGNMENT\n\n[Design the complete Foodgo burger-ordering app: browse the menu, inspect a burger, customize it, pay, and get support or manage the profile.] Design the complete Foodgo burger-ordering app: browse the menu, inspect a burger, customize it, pay, and get support or manage the profile.\n\n[English interface / US dollars ($) / one signed-in customer: Sophia Patel. Base viewport 430 × 932 for every frame; Home and Customize may scroll vertically.] English interface / US dollars ($) / one signed-in customer: Sophia Patel. Base viewport 430 × 932 for every frame; Home and Customize may scroll vertically.\n\n[FIXED by this brief: frame list & names, the content each frame must contain (what, not how), navigation structure, all data and copy, the two brand colors (red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F), typefaces (Lobster logotype + Roboto), media, a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell.] FIXED by this brief: frame list & names, the content each frame must contain (what, not how), navigation structure, all data and copy, the two brand colors (red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F), typefaces (Lobster logotype + Roboto), media, a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell.\n\n[YOURS to decide: layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen; all other colors (neutrals, text, surfaces, rating, semantic); type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states (selected, favourited, added, checked, pressed, disabled, focused, destructive); headers, bottom navigation, dialogs and every business component.] YOURS to decide: layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen; all other colors (neutrals, text, surfaces, rating, semantic); type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; all states (selected, favourited, added, checked, pressed, disabled, focused, destructive); headers, bottom navigation, dialogs and every business component.\n\n[FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES] FRAMES TO DELIVER (11) — USE THESE EXACT NAMES\n\n[01_Splash · 02_Home · 03_Product_Cheeseburger · 04_Product_Veggie · 05_Product_Chicken · 06_Product_Fried_Chicken ·] 01_Splash · 02_Home · 03_Product_Cheeseburger · 04_Product_Veggie · 05_Product_Chicken · 06_Product_Fried_Chicken ·\n\n[07_Customize · 08_Payment · 09_Payment_Success_Overlay · 10_Profile · 11_Support_Chat. One frame per state.] 07_Customize · 08_Payment · 09_Payment_Success_Overlay · 10_Profile · 11_Support_Chat. One frame per state.\n\n[FRAME-BY-FRAME CHECKLIST] FRAME-BY-FRAME CHECKLIST\n\n[Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks. Layout, grouping, emphasis and styling are your decisions.] Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks. Layout, grouping, emphasis and styling are your decisions.\n\n[01_Splash] 01_Splash\n\n[Goal: brand recognition while the app loads.] Goal: brand recognition while the app loads.\n\n[Must include: • Brand: Foodgo wordmark • Media: Splash_Burger_Stack] Must include:\n• Brand: Foodgo wordmark\n• Media: Splash_Burger_Stack\n\n[Links: auto-advances to 02_Home.] Links: auto-advances to 02_Home.\n\n[02_Home] 02_Home\n\n[Goal: find a burger fast — by search, category or browsing.] Goal: find a burger fast — by search, category or browsing.\n\n[Must include: • Account: avatar • Brand: Foodgo wordmark · “Order your favourite food!” • Categories: All / Combos / Sliders / Classic · current: All • Main navigation: current tab Home · Add entry • Menu: 4 items, each with image, category, name, rating and favourite toggle · Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger is a favourite • Search & filter: search “Search” · filter entry] Must include:\n• Account: avatar\n• Brand: Foodgo wordmark · “Order your favourite food!”\n• Categories: All / Combos / Sliders / Classic · current: All\n• Main navigation: current tab Home · Add entry\n• Menu: 4 items, each with image, category, name, rating and favourite toggle · Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger is a favourite\n• Search & filter: search “Search” · filter entry\n\n[Links: each menu item → its product frame (03–06); Profile tab → 10_Profile; Support tab → 11_Support_Chat.] Links: each menu item → its product frame (03–06); Profile tab → 10_Profile; Support tab → 11_Support_Chat.\n\n[03–06_Product_* (4 frames, same structure)] 03–06_Product_* (4 frames, same structure)\n\n[Goal: judge a burger and choose spice level and portions before ordering.] Goal: judge a burger and choose spice level and portions before ordering.\n\n[Must include: • Actions: back · search · Order Now • Burger: image · full name · rating · preparation time · description • Portion: current portion, can be decreased / increased • Price: price for the current portion • Spicy: level from Mild to Hot · current level Data per burger: see DATA.] Must include:\n• Actions: back · search · Order Now\n• Burger: image · full name · rating · preparation time · description\n• Portion: current portion, can be decreased / increased\n• Price: price for the current portion\n• Spicy: level from Mild to Hot · current level\nData per burger: see DATA.\n\n[Links: back → 02_Home; Order Now on 03_Product_Cheeseburger → 07_Customize (Order Now on 04–06 is entry only).] Links: back → 02_Home; Order Now on 03_Product_Cheeseburger → 07_Customize (Order Now on 04–06 is entry only).\n\n[07_Customize] 07_Customize\n\n[Goal: personalize the Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger and see the total before paying.] Goal: personalize the Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger and see the total before paying.\n\n[Must include: • Actions: back · search · Order Now • Add-ons: “Toppings” Tomato, Onions, Pickles, Bacon, Cheese, Mushroom, Avocado · “Side options” Fries, Coleslaw, Salad, Onion Rings, Mozzarella Sticks · each can be added or removed · added: Tomato, Cheese, Fries • Copy: “Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience” • Media: Burger_Exploded_Custom • Portion: 2, can be decreased / increased • Spicy: level from Mild to Hot · current level • Total: $16.48] Must include:\n• Actions: back · search · Order Now\n• Add-ons: “Toppings” Tomato, Onions, Pickles, Bacon, Cheese, Mushroom, Avocado · “Side options” Fries, Coleslaw, Salad, Onion Rings, Mozzarella Sticks · each can be added or removed · added: Tomato, Cheese, Fries\n• Copy: “Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience”\n• Media: Burger_Exploded_Custom\n• Portion: 2, can be decreased / increased\n• Spicy: level from Mild to Hot · current level\n• Total: $16.48\n\n[Links: back → 03_Product_Cheeseburger; Order Now → 08_Payment.] Links: back → 03_Product_Cheeseburger; Order Now → 08_Payment.\n\n[08_Payment] 08_Payment\n\n[Goal: verify the order cost and pay with a saved card.] Goal: verify the order cost and pay with a saved card.\n\n[Must include: • Actions: back · search · Pay Now • Order summary: “Order summary” · Order $16.48 · Taxes $0.30 · Delivery fees $1.50 · Total $18.28 · Estimated delivery time 15–30 mins • Payment methods: “Payment methods” · Credit card (Mastercard, 5105 **** **** 0505) · Debit card (Visa, 3566 **** **** 0505) · only one can be chosen · current: Credit card • Save card: “Save card details for future payments” · on • Total price: $18.28] Must include:\n• Actions: back · search · Pay Now\n• Order summary: “Order summary” · Order $16.48 · Taxes $0.30 · Delivery fees $1.50 · Total $18.28 · Estimated delivery time 15–30 mins\n• Payment methods: “Payment methods” · Credit card (Mastercard, 5105 **** **** 0505) · Debit card (Visa, 3566 **** **** 0505) · only one can be chosen · current: Credit card\n• Save card: “Save card details for future payments” · on\n• Total price: $18.28\n\n[Links: back → 07_Customize; Pay Now → 09_Payment_Success_Overlay.] Links: back → 07_Customize; Pay Now → 09_Payment_Success_Overlay.\n\n[09_Payment_Success_Overlay] 09_Payment_Success_Overlay\n\n[Goal: confirm the payment unambiguously.] Goal: confirm the payment unambiguously.\n\n[Must include: • Actions: Go Back • Copy: “Success!” · “Your payment was successful. A receipt for this purchase has been sent to your email.” • Presentation: dialog over 08_Payment; Payment stays behind it • Status: success mark] Must include:\n• Actions: Go Back\n• Copy: “Success!” · “Your payment was successful. A receipt for this purchase has been sent to your email.”\n• Presentation: dialog over 08_Payment; Payment stays behind it\n• Status: success mark\n\n[Links: Go Back → 02_Home.] Links: Go Back → 02_Home.\n\n[10_Profile] 10_Profile\n\n[Goal: review account details and reach account actions.] Goal: review account details and reach account actions.\n\n[Must include: • Account: avatar · Delivery address 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY · Email sophiapatel@gmail.com · Name Sophia Patel · Password (masked, locked) • Actions: back · settings · Edit Profile · Log out • Entries: Order history · Payment Details] Must include:\n• Account: avatar · Delivery address 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY · Email sophiapatel@gmail.com · Name Sophia Patel · Password (masked, locked)\n• Actions: back · settings · Edit Profile · Log out\n• Entries: Order history · Payment Details\n\n[Links: back → 02_Home.] Links: back → 02_Home.\n\n[11_Support_Chat] 11_Support_Chat\n\n[Goal: get a delivery update from support.] Goal: get a delivery update from support.\n\n[Must include: • Actions: back · menu · send • Conversation: 7 items in the order given in DATA — each message from the agent or the customer · timestamp “26 minutes ago” after the agent’s third message • Input: “Type here...”] Must include:\n• Actions: back · menu · send\n• Conversation: 7 items in the order given in DATA — each message from the agent or the customer · timestamp “26 minutes ago” after the agent’s third message\n• Input: “Type here...”\n\n[Links: back → 02_Home.] Links: back → 02_Home.\n\n[STRUCTURE (FIXED)] STRUCTURE (FIXED)\n\n[Main navigation on 02_Home — in this order: Home → 02 · Profile → 10 · Support → 11 · Favourites (entry only), plus a central Add (entry only). The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours.] Main navigation on 02_Home — in this order: Home → 02 · Profile → 10 · Support → 11 · Favourites (entry only), plus a central Add (entry only). The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours.\n\n[Order flow: Home → Product → Customize → Payment → Success dialog (over Payment) → Home. Product, Customize, Payment, Profile and Support use back navigation.] Order flow: Home → Product → Customize → Payment → Success dialog (over Payment) → Home. Product, Customize, Payment, Profile and Support use back navigation.\n\n[Entry-only (no screen required): search, filter, Combos / Sliders / Classic results, settings, menu, Payment Details, Order history, Edit Profile, Log out, Order Now on 04–06.] Entry-only (no screen required): search, filter, Combos / Sliders / Classic results, settings, menu, Payment Details, Order history, Edit Profile, Log out, Order Now on 04–06.\n\n[DATA & COPY (FIXED)] DATA & COPY (FIXED)\n\n[Customer: Sophia Patel · sophiapatel@gmail.com · 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY. Use Avatar_Neutral wherever the customer appears.] Customer: Sophia Patel · sophiapatel@gmail.com · 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY. Use Avatar_Neutral wherever the customer appears.\n\n[Menu (category · name · rating · time · price per portion → portion shown on its product frame = price shown):] Menu (category · name · rating · time · price per portion → portion shown on its product frame = price shown):\n\n[Cheeseburger · Wendy’s Burger · 4.9 · 26 mins · $8.24 → portion 1 = $8.24 · Hamburger · Veggie Burger · 4.8 · 14 mins · $9.99 → portion 1 = $9.99] Cheeseburger · Wendy’s Burger · 4.9 · 26 mins · $8.24 → portion 1 = $8.24 · Hamburger · Veggie Burger · 4.8 · 14 mins · $9.99 → portion 1 = $9.99\n\n[Hamburger · Chicken Burger · 4.6 · 42 mins · $6.24 → portion 2 = $12.48 · Hamburger · Fried Chicken Burger · 4.5 · 14 mins · $6.75 → portion 4 = $27.00] Hamburger · Chicken Burger · 4.6 · 42 mins · $6.24 → portion 2 = $12.48 · Hamburger · Fried Chicken Burger · 4.5 · 14 mins · $6.75 → portion 4 = $27.00\n\n[Descriptions — Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger: “A classic fast food burger that packs a punch of flavor in every bite: a juicy beef patty cooked to perfection, topped with melted American cheese, crispy lettuce, ripe tomato and crunchy pickles.”] Descriptions — Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burger: “A classic fast food burger that packs a punch of flavor in every bite: a juicy beef patty cooked to perfection, topped with melted American cheese, crispy lettuce, ripe tomato and crunchy pickles.”\n\n[Veggie: “A savory blend of fresh vegetables and herbs, topped with crisp lettuce, juicy tomatoes and tangy pickles, served on a soft, toasted bun.”] Veggie: “A savory blend of fresh vegetables and herbs, topped with crisp lettuce, juicy tomatoes and tangy pickles, served on a soft, toasted bun.”\n\n[Chicken: “A delicious and healthier alternative to traditional beef burgers, perfect for a lighter meal.”] Chicken: “A delicious and healthier alternative to traditional beef burgers, perfect for a lighter meal.”\n\n[Fried Chicken: “A juicy chicken patty, hand-breaded and deep-fried to perfection, served on a warm bun with lettuce, tomato and a creamy sauce.”] Fried Chicken: “A juicy chicken patty, hand-breaded and deep-fried to perfection, served on a warm bun with lettuce, tomato and a creamy sauce.”\n\n[Customize: add-ons are included at no extra cost; Total = 2 × $8.24 = $16.48. Payment: $16.48 + $0.30 + $1.50 = $18.28 (same total in summary and at Pay Now).] Customize: add-ons are included at no extra cost; Total = 2 × $8.24 = $16.48. Payment: $16.48 + $0.30 + $1.50 = $18.28 (same total in summary and at Pay Now).\n\n[Chat (A = agent, C = customer): A “Hi, how can I help you?” · C “Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?” · A “Ok, please let me check!” · C “Sure...” ·] Chat (A = agent, C = customer): A “Hi, how can I help you?” · C “Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy’s Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?” · A “Ok, please let me check!” · C “Sure...” ·\n\n[A “It’ll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.” · [26 minutes ago] · C “Ok, thank you for your support.”] A “It’ll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.” · [26 minutes ago] · C “Ok, thank you for your support.”\n\n[The source file has inconsistent totals ($16.49 / $18.19), a mismatched order in chat and typos (“Bacons”, “thanks you”). Follow this brief, not the source.] The source file has inconsistent totals ($16.49 / $18.19), a mismatched order in chat and typos (“Bacons”, “thanks you”). Follow this brief, not the source.\n\n[HANDOFF & EVALUATION] HANDOFF & EVALUATION\n\n[Copy Components and Media into your own new Figma file; do not edit, rename or delete anything in this starter file.] Copy Components and Media into your own new Figma file; do not edit, rename or delete anything in this starter file.\n\n[Deliver all 11 frames with the exact names above, prototype links as listed, and your own reusable components. Submit your file link.] Deliver all 11 frames with the exact names above, prototype links as listed, and your own reusa