{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610281959435458285258268d9d6lrzTwOCS","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"history:[]text:Reasoning summary:\nI have completed building all 11 required screens inside the \"03 · Workspace\" page of the assigned Figma file. Every frame includes the required platform shell elements (iOS status bar and home indicator), respects the brand visual guidelines (using correct Lobster and Roboto typography and official colors #EF2A39 and #3C2F2F), replicates the precise data structures, lists correct pricing details, and uses proper component instancing. I have also implemented the functional interactive prototype flows (using modern Dissolve transitions and AFTER_TIMEOUT trigger delays for the Splash auto-advance, back buttons, item selection, and payment success paths) and visually verified each frame via screenshots.\n\nFinal answer:\nI have successfully designed and delivered the complete Foodgo mobile product design inside **03 · Workspace** in the assigned copy.\n\n### 📋 Project & Workspace Details\n* **Figma File URL:** https://www.figma.com/design/pNVsMbFlqHuHgCQFsjUPkH/\n* **Workspace Page ID (03 · Workspace):** `2002:2`\n* **Account Used:** `fulinbo@tetras.ai` (Figma Sensenova design Enterprise plan, Full Seat)\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Screen IDs & Deliverables (11 Frames inside Workspace)\nAll viewports are configured at the exact base size of `430 × 932` px, with scroll overflow configurations where required:\n\n1. **`01_Splash` (ID: `2004:2`):** Brand red backdrop, instanced White Wordmark, and centered `Splash_Burger_Stack` graphic.\n2. **`02_Home` (ID: `2004:3`):** Clean light UI containing a dark wordmark, customer avatar (`Avatar_Neutral`), search bar placeholder, filter option, horizontal Categories selectors (with `All` active in red), bottom navigation bar, and 4 elegant menu item cards (ratings, favorite toggles, pricing, and dark brown plus buttons).\n3. **`03_Product_Cheeseburger` (ID: `2004:4`):** Features Wendy’s Burger with rating (`4.9`), preparation time (`26 mins`), full description, Portion selector (`1`), Spicy selection segment (`Mild`), and sticky checkout footer with price `$8.24` and \"Order Now\" action button.\n4. **`04_Product_Veggie` (ID: `2004:5`):** Features Veggie Burger with rating (`4.8`), prep time (`14 mins`), full description, Portion selector (`1`), Spicy Mild segment, and checkout footer with price `$9.99`.\n5. **`05_Product_Chicken` (ID: `2004:6`):** Features Chicken Burger with rating (`4.6`), prep time (`42 mins`), Portion selector (`2`), Spicy Mild segment, and checkout footer with price `$12.48`.\n6. **`06_Product_Fried_Chicken` (ID: `2004:7`):** Features Fried Chicken Burger with rating (`4.5`), prep time (`14 mins`), Portion selector (`4`), Spicy Mild segment, and checkout footer with price `$27.00`.\n7. **`07_Customize` (ID: `2004:8` - height 1200px):** Includes exploded view custom burger media, Portion selector (`2`), Spicy level chips, a scrollable horizontal carousels selector for Toppings (featuring Tomato & Cheese active with red stroke and checkmark, and others with plus button), side options carousel (featuring Fries active with checkmark), and Sticky Footer with calculated total `$16.48`.\n8. **`08_Payment` (ID: `2004:9`):** Interactive order summary section (Order `$16.48`, Taxes `$0.30`, Delivery fees `$1.50`, and Total `$18.28` with estimated delivery time `15-30 mins`), selectable card choices (Credit card Mastercard active in brand red / Debit card Visa inactive), customized toggled ON switch for \"Save card details\", and Pay Now sticky footer with total price `$18.28`.\n9. **`09_Payment_Success_Overlay` (ID: `2004:10`):** Simulates an elegant native modal popup over `08_Payment` using a 50% opacity backdrop blur, custom checkmark vector, \"Success!\" title with copy, and interactive \"Go Back\" action button.\n10. **`10_Profile` (ID: `2004:11`):** User profile details displaying large avatar placeholder, name Sophia Patel, email, interactive \"Edit Profile\" button, Delivery Address container, masked Password card with secure Lock icon, interactive list entries (Order history and Payment Details with chevrons), and red-themed \"Log out\" button.\n11. **`11_Support_Chat` (ID: `2004:12`):** Live chat view containing custom-designed message bubbles for the exact 7-item sequence (with correct text, spacing, and alternating gray/red color alignments), a precise \"26 minutes ago\" center-aligned timestamp, and bottom input box with \"Type here...\" placeholder and red send button.\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ Prototype Flows & Interactions Built\nThe prototype connections are fully mapped using clean **Dissolve** transitions (300ms, Ease In/Out) for a professional animated experience:\n* **Auto-Advance:** `01_Splash` triggers an `AFTER_TIMEOUT` (1500ms delay) to transition seamlessly into `02_Home`.\n* **Menu Navigation:** Tapping menu item cards inside the list on `02_Home` navigates to their respective detail product screens (`03`–`06`).\n* **Checkout Flow:** `03_Product_Cheeseburger` Order Now ➔ `07_Customize` Order Now ➔ `08_Payment` Pay Now ➔ `09_Payment_Success_Overlay` dialog modal ➔ Go Back ➔ resets safely to `02_Home`.\n* **Bottom Bar Navigation:** User Profile and Chat icons on `02_Home` link to `10_Profile` and `11_Support_Chat`.\n* **Back Flow:** All Back buttons on product pages, Customize, Payment, Profile, and Chat screens safely return users to the previous frame in the hierarchy."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":88628,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"494b4549-32cd-4fcc-b024-fd0ae7aff445","uuid":"ca996e5d-5f8d-4f5c-828c-3e18cb7696ff","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:59:55.268Z"}
